{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not convert MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** This routes a transient logging-infrastructure failure through `finishFailure` before the handler or start hooks run, producing a durable `FAILED` result. Treat capture as best-effort with an empty baseline and guarded clearing, or propagate a retryable invocation-level failure; update the test that currently expects `FAILED`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc773rbW","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"5029bdc35c83eaf326890f40f17eaa85614a031a4390bba3fe8e3b3fd50ffbb8","observation_id":"aro_v1_kau33q24qpvpgjujb5apc7vkqv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:05Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vt34dnzhr72mh75qityehqrhqi","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a43deba101516dc5a2fb5f51733728623cc57e1a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qblykzeqhsfjp5e3zlnzrvz54w","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:05Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
